OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWindy this morning with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain for many, the rain
OL,7,Fheaviest and most persistent on
OL,8,Fwestern hills. Drier and brighter this
OL,9,Fafternoon as rain clears south,
OL,10,Fhowever a few isolated showers are
OL,11,Fstill likely. Strong winds easing with
OL,12,Ftime.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FClear spells and isolated
OL,15,Fshowers this evening, winds continuing
OL,16,Fto ease. More extensively dry
OL,17,Fovernight with increasingly clear
OL,18,Fskies. Perhaps the odd fog patch
OL,19,Fforming by dawn in prone spots.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
