OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FDry and widely bright or
OL,6,Fsunny, along with light winds.
OL,7,FTemperatures a little lower compared
OL,8,Fto Saturday.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMostly
OL,11,Ffine, bright to start Monday, becoming
OL,12,Fwarm. Occasional rain, stronger winds
OL,13,Fdeveloping later. Cooler by Tuesday,
OL,14,Fwith bright or sunny spells and
OL,15,Fisolated blustery showers. Similar on
OL,16,FWednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
